{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "جَعَلْنَا", "translation": "We made"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَيْتَ", "translation": "the House"}, {"text": "مَثَابَةًۭ", "translation": "a place of return"}, {"text": "لِّلنَّاسِ", "translation": "for mankind"}, {"text": "وَأَمْنًۭا", "translation": "and (a place of) security"}, {"text": "وَٱتَّخِذُوا۟", "translation": "and (said), \"Take"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "[from]"}, {"text": "مَّقَامِ", "translation": "(the) standing place"}, {"text": "إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ", "translation": "(of) Ibrahim"}, {"text": "مُصَلًّۭى ۖ", "translation": "(as) a place of prayer"}, {"text": "وَعَهِدْنَآ", "translation": "And We made a covenant"}, {"text": "إِلَىٰٓ", "translation": "with"}, {"text": "إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ", "translation": "Ibrahim"}, {"text": "وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ", "translation": "and Ishmael"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "[that]"}, {"text": "طَهِّرَا", "translation": "[You both] purify"}, {"text": "بَيْتِىَ", "translation": "My House"}, {"text": "لِلطَّآئِفِينَ", "translation": "for those who circumambulate"}, {"text": "وَٱلْعَـٰكِفِينَ", "translation": "and those who seclude themselves for devotion and prayer"}, {"text": "وَٱلرُّكَّعِ", "translation": "and those who bow down"}, {"text": "ٱلسُّجُودِ", "translation": "and those who prostrate"}], "sahih": "And [mention] when We made the House [i.e., the Kaʿbah] a place of return for the people and [a place of] security. And take, [O believers], from the standing place of Abraham a place of prayer. And We charged Abraham and Ishmael, [saying], \"Purify My House for those who perform ṭawāf1 and those who are staying [there] for worship and those who bow and prostrate [in prayer].\""}